{"anim_count":2,"animations":[{"index":0,"preset_class":1,"preset_id":2,"preset_subtype":4,"seq_type":"STTLTimeNodeType_mainSeq","shape_id":"00020b","trigger_id":"kDefaultTriggerId"},{"index":1,"preset_class":1,"preset_id":2,"preset_subtype":2,"seq_type":"STTLTimeNodeType_mainSeq","shape_id":"00020d","trigger_id":"kDefaultTriggerId"}],"page_id":"000010","page_index":10,"shape_count":6,"shapes":[{"children":[{"border_alpha":100,"border_color":"FFFFFF","border_width":0.75,"fill":"F2F2F2","h":44,"id":"000208","text":"\r","type":"shape","w":944,"x":0,"y":4},{"fill":"none","font_color":"000000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":28.0,"h":101,"id":"000209","text":" 通过Na、Fe、Cu、H2在氯气中燃烧，对燃烧的条件与本质有什么新的认识？\r","type":"shape","w":944,"x":0,"y":0}],"h":101,"id":"00020a","type":"group","w":945,"x":15,"y":55},{"fill":"none","font_color":"000000","font_name":"微软雅黑","font_size":28.0,"h":186,"id":"00020b","text":"①燃烧不一定需要氧气。\r②燃烧的本质是还原剂(可燃物)与氧化剂(助燃剂)之间的\r   剧烈的发光发热的氧化还原反应。\r","type":"shape","w":721,"x":75,"y":109},{"fill":"none","font_color":"000000","font_name":"宋体","font_size":27.99,"h":141,"id":"00020c","text":"1.下列说法中，不正确的是（  ）\r  A.燃烧一定伴有发光现象     B.燃烧一定是氧化还原反应\r  C.燃烧一定要有氧气参加     D.燃烧一定会放出热量\r","type":"shape","w":915,"x":30,"y":325},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":30.0,"h":55,"id":"00020d","text":"C\r","type":"shape","w":41,"x":405,"y":334},{"h":46,"id":"00020e","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image23.png/6u891f","type":"picture","w":201,"x":759,"y":0},{"h":46,"id":"00020f","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image12.jpg/6u891f","type":"picture","w":753,"x":0,"y":0}],"version":0}
